# The keys that move the map: Ctrl with F7 to F10 remembers the place the map
# shows, the key alone goes back there, and Home centers the map on what is
# selected. The second GDI mission, whose map is larger than the screen, with
# the shroud lifted by the developers' F4 so that the place shows.
# args: -PLAYTEST -NEWGAMESCG02EA
at 300 key F4
at 320 shot start
at 321 keydown CTRL
at 322 key F7
at 325 keyup CTRL
# The pointer at the bottom edge scrolls the map down.
at 330 move 240 399
at 400 shot scrolled_down
at 401 move 240 300
at 402 keydown CTRL
at 403 key F10
at 406 keyup CTRL
at 410 key F7
at 430 shot f7_view
at 431 key F10
at 450 shot f10_view
at 451 key F7
at 470 click 60 183
at 490 shot unit_selected
at 491 key F10
at 510 shot f10_view_again
at 511 key HOME
at 530 shot home_on_the_unit
at 531 quit
